#!/bin/sh
set -e
# Beim Entfernen (oder abgebrochener Installation) Debians os-release zurueckholen
if [ "$1" = remove ] || [ "$1" = purge ] || [ "$1" = abort-install ]; then
    if dpkg-divert --list /usr/lib/os-release | grep -q biblix-system; then
        [ -f /usr/lib/os-release.debian ] && mv -f /usr/lib/os-release.debian /usr/lib/os-release
        dpkg-divert --package biblix-system --no-rename --remove /usr/lib/os-release >/dev/null
    fi
fi
exit 0
